=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackal Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 2/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dune-alpha-hide\" title=\"Dune Alpha Hide - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/06d4d7f57b1ebe34de06.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Alpha Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-legs\" title=\"Bearhide Legs - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d5f0c0f64a5f6fd492e9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Inferior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"sunbleached-fang\" title=\"Sunbleached Fang - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sunbleached Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"bodkin-bolt\" title=\"Bodkin Bolt - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7a